## What went wrong

The script stopped with an error:

    error[Z0001]: a wage of 50,000 or more
     --> scripts/main.zeff:3:1
      |
    3 | assert(staff.max(wage) < 50000, "a wage of 50,000 or more")
      | ^^^^^^ in this call

